{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672020/extras/52e1821786c54d4e0a56eec39745f43b.webp?t=1767577854\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672020/extras/52e1821786c54d4e0a56eec39745f43b.poster.avif?t=1767577854\" class=\"bb_img\" width=615 height=175 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist the full version to play the complete Monster Merchant Simulator game.\u00a0</strong>A free prologue for Monster Merchant Simulator.  Hatch, train, and evolve monsters, capture wild creatures, and build arenas for epic customer battles. Collect rare resources, brew powerful potions, craft items, and use them on your monsters, or sell your creations and monsters in your store.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hatching Monster Eggs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672020/extras/dcfef509943d88bb63234a64d15ac5af.avif?t=1767577854\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672020/extras_big/dcfef509943d88bb63234a64d15ac5af.avif?t=1767577854 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase different types of eggs to hatch monsters and unlock additional incubators as you progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Monster Collection Book</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672020/extras/c98db6e3f8013fbe7ca13534a1de8b12.avif?t=1767577854\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672020/extras_big/c98db6e3f8013fbe7ca13534a1de8b12.avif?t=1767577854 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hundreds of monsters in your collection book and discover all the mythical monsters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Train Your Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672020/extras/155cb505adba3e85a0bd1e81093e9050.avif?t=1767577854\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672020/extras_big/155cb505adba3e85a0bd1e81093e9050.avif?t=1767577854 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your monsters and hire trainers to help them reach their full potential.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crafting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672020/extras/4809a0630b0f3ea21ebda792a9da19ce.avif?t=1767577854\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672020/extras_big/4809a0630b0f3ea21ebda792a9da19ce.avif?t=1767577854 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock valuable recipes, collect resources from the wild, and craft various items and potions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evolve Your Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672020/extras/152f5673daf6eb4f2fa6b7cee2a2c04b.avif?t=1767577854\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672020/extras_big/152f5673daf6eb4f2fa6b7cee2a2c04b.avif?t=1767577854 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use crafted items and potions to power up your monsters, and evolve them when they're ready.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Capture Wild Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672020/extras/efca436771294067ac16d9b90ae8b722.avif?t=1767577854\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672020/extras_big/efca436771294067ac16d9b90ae8b722.avif?t=1767577854 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your dart gun to capture wild monsters in the woods. Train and evolve them in your store. Don\u2019t miss your shot when the legendary monster appears!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Arenas for Your Customers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672020/extras/821e63c7ee90553a3671ff60ad786c40.avif?t=1767577854\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672020/extras_big/821e63c7ee90553a3671ff60ad786c40.avif?t=1767577854 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build battle arenas for your customers to enjoy epic monster fights. Arrange groups of opponents as you wish and see who comes out on top.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672020?t=1767577854","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672020?t=1767577854","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672020/dcfc81d45252e65ba94dcba658f46acef6f4f688/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767577854","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672020/dcfc81d45252e65ba94dcba658f46acef6f4f688/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767577854","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672020/extras/52e1821786c54d4e0